    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48023" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θει-ασμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>superstition</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαν θειασμῷ προσκείμενος</span>, of
			Nicias, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>inspiration, frenzy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θειασμοῖς κάτοχοι γυναῖκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					7.68
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θειασμοῦ [ἐπιρρήματα</span>],
			such as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐοἵ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				642.17
			</span></i>.</div>
